+0     accept

+0     send 100
+1.000 > . 1:2(1) ack 1
+0.010 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 0
+1.990 > . 1:2(1) ack 1
+0.010 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 1000
+0     > . 1:101(100) ack 1
